            "returnType": "boolean",
            "sourceCode": "let getOnhand = $context.$nodes.LABEL_DATA_EXTRACTION_NODE.$output.Onhand;\nlet sub = $context.$nodes.LABEL_DATA_EXTRACTION_NODE.$output.Subinventory;\n\n// Treat null, undefined, \"null\", and empty/whitespace as invalid\nlet isValid =\n  sub !== null &&\n  sub !== undefined &&\n  String(sub).trim().toLowerCase() !== 'null' &&\n  String(sub).trim() !== '';\n\nisValid = (getOnhand === true || getOnhand === 'true') && isValid;\n\nreturn isValid;"
          },
