                            "returnType": "array",
                            "sourceCode": "let oldArray = $context.$variables.LotKeyData;\n\nlet itemFromReceipt = $context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_LSR_ITEM_GET_LOT_KEY_FOR_SERIAL_LABELS.GET_LSR_ITEM_NUMBER_FOR_SERIAL_LABELS.$output.result;\n\nlet transID = $context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_LSR_ITEM_GET_LOT_KEY_FOR_SERIAL_LABELS.GET_LSR_TRANSACTION_ID_FOR_SERIAL_LABELS.$output.result;\n\nlet jsonData = $context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_LSR_ITEM_GET_LOT_KEY_FOR_SERIAL_LABELS.WHILE_TRANSACTION_HAS_MORE_LSR_ITEM_KEYS_FOR_SERIAL_LABELS.FETCH_NEXT_LOT_KEYS_FROM_TRANSACTION_SERIAL_LABELS.$output;\n\nlet transactionData = [...oldArray];\n\njsonData.items.forEach(item => {\n  transactionData.push({\n    lotKey: item['@context'].key,   \n    itemNumber: itemFromReceipt,\n    transactionId: transID\n  });\n});\n\nreturn transactionData;"
