              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Make a valid JSON object using the following data. Use the keys and values provided. If the values are not given then just set that value as null. \n\n\"ReportName\": {{$context.$nodes.LABEL_DATA_EXTRACTION_NODE.$output.ReportName}}\n\"Receipt\": {{$context.$nodes.LABEL_DATA_EXTRACTION_NODE.$output.Receipt}}\n\"Shipment\": {{$context.$nodes.LABEL_DATA_EXTRACTION_NODE.$output.Shipment}}\n\"Organization\": {{$context.$nodes.LABEL_DATA_EXTRACTION_NODE.$output.Organization}}\n\"Associated\": {{$context.$nodes.LABEL_DATA_EXTRACTION_NODE.$output.Associated}}\n\"Onhand\": {{$context.$nodes.LABEL_DATA_EXTRACTION_NODE.$output.Onhand}}\n\"Subinventory\": {{$context.$nodes.LABEL_DATA_EXTRACTION_NODE.$output.Subinventory}}\n\"Locator\": {{$context.$nodes.LABEL_DATA_EXTRACTION_NODE.$output.Locator}}\n\"ReportURL\": {{$context.$nodes.PRINT_ITEM_LABEL.$output.ReportDownloadURL}}\n\"JobProcess\": {{$context.$nodes.PRINT_ITEM_LABEL.$output. ProcessJobId}}\n\"Printer\": {{$context.$nodes.LABEL_DATA_EXTRACTION_NODE.$output.Printer}}\n\"EmailFrom\": {{$context.$nodes.LABEL_DATA_EXTRACTION_NODE.$output.EmailFromAddress}}\n\"EmailTo\": {{$context.$nodes.LABEL_DATA_EXTRACTION_NODE.$output.EmailToAddress}}\n\"EmailServer\": {{$context.$nodes.LABEL_DATA_EXTRACTION_NODE.$output.EmailServer}}"
