              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Given the following inputs, Return exactly the same object, only ensuring it is valid JSON (keys with : and proper quotes). Do not wrap it in an additional object, rename keys, or change the structure in any way. If the input does not have any value don't return anything as the output.\n\nDo Not: Hallucinate keys or values.\nReturn only a valid JSON object. Do not wrap in ``` and do not include explanations.\n\nItem Label Input:\n {{$context.$nodes.RETURN_ITEM_OBJECT_LLM.$output}} \n\nSerial Label Input:\n{{$context.$nodes.RETURN_SERIAL_OBJECT_LLM.$output}}\n\nLot Label Input:\n {{$context.$nodes.LOT_OBJECT_LLM.$output}}\n\nLocation Label Input:\n {{$context.$nodes.LOCATION_OBJECT_LLM.$output}}\n\nDelivery Label Input:\n {{$context.$nodes.DELIVERY_RECEIPT_OBJECT_LLM.$output}}\n\nLPN Label Input:\n {{$context.$nodes.LPN_OBJECT_LLM.$output}}"
            }
